297:/// Builds a [Widget] for a single [BlockNode]. Registered per [BlockType] in a
298:/// [BlockRendererRegistry]. Custom renderers receive the same
299:/// [BlockRenderContext] the built-in ones do, so they can participate in
300:/// selection/caret/debug behaviour.
301:typedef BlockRendererBuilder = Widget Function(
