306:/// Maps [BlockType]s and custom [BlockEmbedNode.embedType]s to
307:/// [BlockRendererBuilder]s. The editor consults this registry to paint each
308:/// block; built-in types ship with default builders, and plugins override or
309:/// extend them via [register] / [registerEmbed].
310:///
311:/// The registry is an indirection point: it lets a consumer replace how a given
312:/// block type renders (e.g. a custom image block with a real decoder) or how a
313:/// business embed type renders without forking the editor widget.
314:///
315:/// To start from the built-in defaults, construct the registry and then call
316:/// [WenzRichTextEditor.installDefaultRenderers]; or use the editor's
317:/// [WenzRichTextEditor.blockRenderers] parameter — when omitted the editor
318:/// builds a private registry with the defaults already installed.
